{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15304440","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15304440","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1530444001:1":{"text":"수프 끓이는 솜씨를 빼면, 나한테 남은 건 이 마음가짐 뿐이거든.","source_cn":"除了熬汤的手艺，我也就剩一个好心态了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FA6DF3103D55FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1530444002:1":{"text":"다들 배고파하니까 수프를 끓이는 거야. 배가 고프면 수프가 먹고 싶어지는 법이잖아.","source_cn":"熬汤是因为大家会饿，会饿就会想喝汤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1703A13C26F383A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1530444003:1":{"text":"좋은 마음가짐... 마음가짐이 좋아야 맛있는 수프를 끓일 수 있어.","source_cn":"好心态……是因为，只要心态好，才能熬出好喝的汤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x073FC03C04065F7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:风丝":{"text":"윈드실크","source":"风丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}